docs/schema-captures/

# Everything under .claude/ is local working state — machine-specific settings,
# agent worktrees, scratch notes, session artifacts. None of it belongs in a
# public package. Ignore the whole directory rather than named files inside it,
# so a future `git add -A` cannot sweep a worktree (a full copy of the repo)
# into a commit.
.claude/

# Local scratch / working notes, wherever they land
NOTES.md
